	WeaponTrailAll: All projectiles
	StealthFx: Stealth
	MotionHint: Dash, steps, weapon trail and stealth use these colors
	StealthHintOn: Calamity stealth: dark haze, glowing eye, outline and a strike flash
	StealthHintOff: Stealth effects work together with Calamity (not loaded now)
