	CompanionHint: Flies next to you and shows in the preview. Purely cosmetic
	CompanionHint2: Does not take the pet slot: you can still have a normal pet
	Dash: Dash
	DashHint: Works with any dash: Shield of Cthulhu, Tabi, Calamity dashes and more
	TabWings: Wings
	WingStyle: Wing style
	Outline: Outline
	WingsHint: Effect wings are drawn over any equipped wings, or even with no wings at all
	WingsHint2: Wings from this mod use these effects on their own, with their own colors
